            {
              "id": "cm0r7x64w002w356utj2iwf2m",
              "heading": "<p><strong>Module 7: Course Conclusion</strong></p>",
              "paragraph": "<p>The conclusion module summarizes the key learning points from the course and emphasizes the importance of focusing on solving real problems, maintaining transparency, minimizing and managing AI risk, and prioritizing the public good. It highlights the crucial role of government leaders in shaping the future of AI in the public sector and the importance of continuous learning, collaboration, and adaptation to navigate the evolving AI landscape with confidence.</p><p>After each video ends, a continue button appears below the video player. Click it to reveal the additional navigation and the InnovateUS website link containing readings and resources. Learners with screen readers can use the down arrow key to navigate through the video player’s controls and access the continue button. <strong><em>Another</em></strong> “continue” button will appear to move on to the Self-Assessments after each video. </p><ul><li><p><strong>Reminder:</strong> Consult with your organization’s policies before using any tool or platform. &nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: The commercial tools mentioned in this course are for illustrative purposes and do not imply endorsement by InnovateUS.</p></li></ul>"
            }
          ],
